{ dg-modules "rcprelude" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Fork", ALGOL 68 solution fork.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Fork#ALGOL_68
  The text of Rosetta Code is available under the GNU Free Documentation
  License 1.3 (see README.md).  The solution is unchanged in orig/fork.a68;
  this copy was prepared for ga68 and converted to SUPPER stropping by
  tools/rosetta_prep.py. }
access Rc_Prelude (
main:
(
  int pid;
  if (pid:=fork)=0 then
    print("This is new process")
  elif pid>0 then
    print("This is the original process")
  else
    print("ERROR: Something went wrong")
  fi
)
)
